      "content": "it's not just about me being tired though. it's the money, the constant appointments, the way my husband looks at me when he thinks i'm not watching... like he's just so tired of the struggle. i just feel like if i wasn't here, so much of that pressure would just disappear for them. like they could finally breathe again.",
